<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>C&oacute;digo de verificaci&oacute;n</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f9fafb;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f9fafb;padding:40px 16px;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <table width="480" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;max-width:480px;width:100%;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:32px 40px 24px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;">
                            <span style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#4f46e5;">e</span><span style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1f2937;">Fact</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:32px 40px;">
                            <h1 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;margin:0 0 8px;text-align:center;">
                                Tu c&oacute;digo de verificaci&oacute;n
                            </h1>
                            <p style="font-size:15px;color:#6b7280;margin:0 0 28px;text-align:center;line-height:1.5;">
                                Usa este c&oacute;digo para completar tu registro en eFact.
                            </p>
                            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                                <tr>
                                    <td align="center">
                                        <div style="background:#eef2ff;border:2px dashed #c7d2fe;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 32px;display:inline-block;">
                                            <span style="font-size:36px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;color:#4f46e5;font-family:monospace;">{{ code }}</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                            <p style="font-size:13px;color:#9ca3af;margin:24px 0 0;text-align:center;line-height:1.5;">
                                Este c&oacute;digo expira en <strong>{{ ttl_minutes }} minutos</strong>.<br>
                                Si no solicitaste este c&oacute;digo, ignora este mensaje.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:20px 40px;background:#f9fafb;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;">
                            <p style="font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin:0;text-align:center;">
                                &copy; eFact &mdash; Mini ERP para empresas peruanas
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
